      "listId": null,
      "nestingLevel": null,
      "table": null,
      "text": "敵の防御力・術耐性 表記ガイド",
      "protectedControls": []
    },
    {
      "paragraphId": "P00003",
      "path": "tabs.t.0.body.content[3]",
      "tabId": "t.0",
      "tabTitle": "Tab 1",
      "segmentId": null,
      "startIndex": 52,
      "endIndex": 76,
      "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT",
      "isListItem": false,
      "listId": null,
      "nestingLevel": null,
      "table": null,
      "text": "段階評価と実数値の対応・ダメージ計算での読み方",
      "protectedControls": []
    },
    {
      "paragraphId": "P00004",
      "path": "tabs.t.0.body.content[4]",
      "tabId": "t.0",
      "tabTitle": "Tab 1",
      "segmentId": null,
      "startIndex": 76,
      "endIndex": 123,
      "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT",
      "isListItem": false,
      "listId": null,
      "nestingLevel": null,
      "table": null,
      "text": "対象画面: Enemy Analysis   |   Version 1.0   |   2026-08-31",
      "protectedControls": []
    },
    {
      "paragraphId": "P00005",
      "path": "tabs.t.0.body.content[5].table.rows[0].cells[0].content[0]",
      "tabId": "t.0",
      "tabTitle": "Tab 1",
      "segmentId": null,
      "startIndex": 126,
      "endIndex": 130,
      "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT",
      "isListItem": false,
      "listId": null,
      "nestingLevel": null,
      "table": {
        "tableStartIndex": 123,
        "rowIndex": 0,
        "columnIndex": 0
      },
      "text": "最重要",
      "protectedControls": []
    },
    {
      "paragraphId": "P00006",
      "path": "tabs.t.0.body.content[5].table.rows[0].cells[0].content[1]",
      "tabId": "t.0",
      "tabTitle": "Tab 1",
      "segmentId": null,
      "startIndex": 130,
      "endIndex": 201,
      "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT",
      "isListItem": false,
      "listId": null,
      "nestingLevel": null,
      "table": {
        "tableStartIndex": 123,
        "rowIndex": 0,
        "columnIndex": 0
      },
      "text": "ゲーム内の文字ランクは、敵の強さをおおまかに示す範囲表記です。正確なダメージ比較には実数値を使い、防御力と術耐性は別の仕組みとして読みます。",
      "protectedControls": []
    },
    {
      "paragraphId": "P00007",
      "path": "tabs.t.0.body.content[6]",
      "tabId": "t.0",
      "tabTitle": "Tab 1",
      "segmentId": null,
      "startIndex": 202,
      "endIndex": 203,
      "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT",
      "isListItem": false,
      "listId": null,
      "nestingLevel": null,
      "table": null,
      "text": "",
      "protectedControls": []
    },
    {
      "paragraphId": "P00008",
      "path": "tabs.t.0.body.content[7]",
      "tabId": "t.0",
      "tabTitle": "Tab 1",
      "segmentId": null,
      "startIndex": 203,
      "endIndex": 215,
      "namedStyleType": "HEADING_1",
      "isListItem": false,
      "listId": null,
      "nestingLevel": null,
      "table": null,
      "text": "1. 表示ランクの意味",
      "protectedControls": []
    },
    {
      "paragraphId": "P00009",
      "path": "tabs.t.0.body.content[8]",
      "tabId": "t.0",
      "tabTitle": "Tab 1",
      "segmentId": null,
      "startIndex": 215,
      "endIndex": 313,
      "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT",
      "isListItem": false,
      "listId": null,
      "nestingLevel": null,
      "table": null,
      "text": "改修後の敵図鑑では、防御力・術耐性を E、D、C、B、B+、A、A+、S、S+、SS の10段階で表示します。文字が上がるほど数値も高くなりますが、画面上のランクだけでは厳密な値は分かりません。",
      "protectedControls": []
    },
    {
      "paragraphId": "P00010",
      "path": "tabs.t.0.body.content[9]",
      "tabId": "t.0",
      "tabTitle": "Tab 1",
      "segmentId": null,
      "startIndex": 313,
      "endIndex": 376,
      "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT",
      "isListItem": true,
      "listId": "kix.list.10",
      "nestingLevel": null,
      "table": null,
      "text": "Enemy Analysis の初期表示は「ゲーム内評価」です。「実数値」へ切り替えると、比較に用いる基礎値を確認できます。",
      "protectedControls": []
    },
    {
      "paragraphId": "P00011",
      "path": "tabs.t.0.body.content[10]",
      "tabId": "t.0",
      "tabTitle": "Tab 1",
      "segmentId": null,
      "startIndex": 376,
      "endIndex": 429,
      "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT",
      "isListItem": true,
      "listId": "kix.list.10",
      "nestingLevel": null,
      "table": null,
      "text": "本アプリは図鑑の評価文字列を直接読むのではなく、取得した実数値をゲーム内と同じ段階基準として換算します。",
      "protectedControls": []
    },
    {
      "paragraphId": "P00012",
      "path": "tabs.t.0.body.content[11]",
      "tabId": "t.0",
      "tabTitle": "Tab 1",
      "segmentId": null,
      "startIndex": 429,
      "endIndex": 464,
      "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT",
      "isListItem": true,
      "listId": "kix.list.10",
      "nestingLevel": null,
      "table": null,
      "text": "値が欠損・未定義・非数値の場合は評価できないため「—」と表示します。",
      "protectedControls": []
    },
    {
      "paragraphId": "P00013",
      "path": "tabs.t.0.body.content[12].table.rows[0].cells[0].content[0]",
      "tabId": "t.0",
      "tabTitle": "Tab 1",
      "segmentId": null,
      "startIndex": 467,
      "endIndex": 475,
      "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT",
      "isListItem": false,
      "listId": null,
      "nestingLevel": null,
      "table": {
        "tableStartIndex": 464,
        "rowIndex": 0,
        "columnIndex": 0
      },
      "text": "10段階の順序",
      "protectedControls": []
    },
    {
      "paragraphId": "P00014",
      "path": "tabs.t.0.body.content[12].table.rows[0].cells[0].content[1]",
      "tabId": "t.0",
      "tabTitle": "Tab 1",
      "segmentId": null,
      "startIndex": 475,
      "endIndex": 515,
      "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT",
      "isListItem": false,
      "listId": null,
      "nestingLevel": null,
      "table": {
        "tableStartIndex": 464,
        "rowIndex": 0,
        "columnIndex": 0
      },
      "text": "左ほど低く、右ほど高い評価です。「+」を含む文字は独立した段階として扱います。",
      "protectedControls": []
    },
    {
      "paragraphId": "P00015",
      "path": "tabs.t.0.body.content[12].table.rows[0].cells[0].content[2]",
      "tabId": "t.0",
