      "nestingLevel": null,
      "table": {
        "tableStartIndex": 574,
        "rowIndex": 10,
        "columnIndex": 2
      },
      "text": "x ≤ 0\u000b通常の値: 0",
      "protectedControls": []
    },
    {
      "paragraphId": "P00052",
      "path": "tabs.t.0.body.content[17]",
      "tabId": "t.0",
      "tabTitle": "Tab 1",
      "segmentId": null,
      "startIndex": 1134,
      "endIndex": 1251,
      "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT",
      "isListItem": false,
      "listId": null,
      "nestingLevel": null,
      "table": null,
      "text": "注: 公式にランク境界の数値表はないため、本表は2026-08-31時点の本アプリ実装値です。判定は丸め前の値に対して行い、整数の目安は読みやすさのために併記しています。境界上では、防御力5000・術耐性90はいずれもS+で、それを超えるとSSです。",
      "protectedControls": []
    },
    {
      "paragraphId": "P00053",
      "path": "tabs.t.0.body.content[18]",
      "tabId": "t.0",
      "tabTitle": "Tab 1",
      "segmentId": null,
      "startIndex": 1251,
      "endIndex": 1253,
      "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT",
      "isListItem": false,
      "listId": null,
      "nestingLevel": null,
      "table": null,
      "text": "",
      "protectedControls": []
    },
    {
      "paragraphId": "P00054",
      "path": "tabs.t.0.body.content[19]",
      "tabId": "t.0",
      "tabTitle": "Tab 1",
      "segmentId": null,
      "startIndex": 1253,
      "endIndex": 1277,
      "namedStyleType": "HEADING_1",
      "isListItem": false,
      "listId": null,
      "nestingLevel": null,
      "table": null,
      "text": "3. 防御力と術耐性は、同じ文字でも働きが違う",
      "protectedControls": []
    },
    {
      "paragraphId": "P00055",
      "path": "tabs.t.0.body.content[20]",
      "tabId": "t.0",
      "tabTitle": "Tab 1",
      "segmentId": null,
      "startIndex": 1277,
      "endIndex": 1346,
      "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT",
      "isListItem": false,
      "listId": null,
      "nestingLevel": null,
      "table": null,
      "text": "防御力は物理ダメージから固定値を差し引き、術耐性は術ダメージを割合で減らします。そのため、同じB+やAでも軽減量が等しいとは限りません。",
      "protectedControls": []
    },
    {
      "paragraphId": "P00056",
      "path": "tabs.t.0.body.content[21].table.rows[0].cells[0].content[0]",
      "tabId": "t.0",
      "tabTitle": "Tab 1",
      "segmentId": null,
      "startIndex": 1349,
      "endIndex": 1362,
      "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT",
      "isListItem": false,
      "listId": null,
      "nestingLevel": null,
      "table": {
        "tableStartIndex": 1346,
        "rowIndex": 0,
        "columnIndex": 0
      },
      "text": "物理ダメージ / 防御力",
      "protectedControls": []
    },
    {
      "paragraphId": "P00057",
      "path": "tabs.t.0.body.content[21].table.rows[0].cells[1].content[0]",
      "tabId": "t.0",
      "tabTitle": "Tab 1",
      "segmentId": null,
      "startIndex": 1363,
      "endIndex": 1375,
      "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT",
      "isListItem": false,
      "listId": null,
      "nestingLevel": null,
      "table": {
        "tableStartIndex": 1346,
        "rowIndex": 0,
        "columnIndex": 1
      },
      "text": "術ダメージ / 術耐性",
      "protectedControls": []
    },
    {
      "paragraphId": "P00058",
      "path": "tabs.t.0.body.content[21].table.rows[1].cells[0].content[0]",
      "tabId": "t.0",
      "tabTitle": "Tab 1",
      "segmentId": null,
      "startIndex": 1377,
      "endIndex": 1390,
      "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT",
      "isListItem": false,
      "listId": null,
      "nestingLevel": null,
      "table": {
        "tableStartIndex": 1346,
        "rowIndex": 1,
        "columnIndex": 0
      },
      "text": "1ヒットごとの固定値減算",
      "protectedControls": []
    },
    {
      "paragraphId": "P00059",
      "path": "tabs.t.0.body.content[21].table.rows[1].cells[1].content[0]",
      "tabId": "t.0",
      "tabTitle": "Tab 1",
      "segmentId": null,
      "startIndex": 1391,
      "endIndex": 1399,
      "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT",
      "isListItem": false,
      "listId": null,
      "nestingLevel": null,
      "table": {
        "tableStartIndex": 1346,
        "rowIndex": 1,
        "columnIndex": 1
      },
      "text": "割合による軽減",
      "protectedControls": []
    },
    {
      "paragraphId": "P00060",
      "path": "tabs.t.0.body.content[21].table.rows[2].cells[0].content[0]",
      "tabId": "t.0",
      "tabTitle": "Tab 1",
      "segmentId": null,
      "startIndex": 1401,
      "endIndex": 1426,
      "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT",
      "isListItem": false,
      "listId": null,
      "nestingLevel": null,
      "table": {
        "tableStartIndex": 1346,
        "rowIndex": 2,
        "columnIndex": 0
      },
      "text": "max(ATK − DEF, ATK × 5%)",
      "protectedControls": []
    },
    {
      "paragraphId": "P00061",
      "path": "tabs.t.0.body.content[21].table.rows[2].cells[1].content[0]",
      "tabId": "t.0",
      "tabTitle": "Tab 1",
      "segmentId": null,
      "startIndex": 1427,
      "endIndex": 1462,
      "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT",
      "isListItem": false,
      "listId": null,
      "nestingLevel": null,
      "table": {
        "tableStartIndex": 1346,
        "rowIndex": 2,
        "columnIndex": 1
      },
      "text": "max(ATK × (1 − RES/100), ATK × 5%)",
      "protectedControls": []
    },
    {
      "paragraphId": "P00062",
      "path": "tabs.t.0.body.content[21].table.rows[3].cells[0].content[0]",
      "tabId": "t.0",
      "tabTitle": "Tab 1",
      "segmentId": null,
      "startIndex": 1464,
      "endIndex": 1477,
      "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT",
      "isListItem": false,
      "listId": null,
      "nestingLevel": null,
      "table": {
        "tableStartIndex": 1346,
        "rowIndex": 3,
        "columnIndex": 0
      },
      "text": "攻撃力と防御力の差が重要",
      "protectedControls": []
    },
    {
      "paragraphId": "P00063",
      "path": "tabs.t.0.body.content[21].table.rows[3].cells[1].content[0]",
      "tabId": "t.0",
      "tabTitle": "Tab 1",
      "segmentId": null,
      "startIndex": 1478,
      "endIndex": 1500,
      "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT",
      "isListItem": false,
      "listId": null,
      "nestingLevel": null,
      "table": {
        "tableStartIndex": 1346,
        "rowIndex": 3,
        "columnIndex": 1
      },
      "text": "RES 1につき約1ポイント軽減率が上がる",
      "protectedControls": []
    },
    {
      "paragraphId": "P00064",
      "path": "tabs.t.0.body.content[22]",
      "tabId": "t.0",
      "tabTitle": "Tab 1",
      "segmentId": null,
      "startIndex": 1501,
      "endIndex": 1508,
      "namedStyleType": "HEADING_2",
      "isListItem": false,
      "listId": null,
      "nestingLevel": null,
      "table": null,
      "text": "同じB+の例",
      "protectedControls": []
    },
    {
      "paragraphId": "P00065",
      "path": "tabs.t.0.body.content[23].table.rows[0].cells[0].content[0]",
      "tabId": "t.0",
      "tabTitle": "Tab 1",
      "segmentId": null,
      "startIndex": 1511,
      "endIndex": 1525,
      "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT",
      "isListItem": false,
      "listId": null,
      "nestingLevel": null,
      "table": {
        "tableStartIndex": 1508,
        "rowIndex": 0,
        "columnIndex": 0
      },
      "text": "例: 攻撃力1000で攻撃",
      "protectedControls": []
    },
    {
      "paragraphId": "P00066",
      "path": "tabs.t.0.body.content[23].table.rows[0].cells[0].content[1]",
      "tabId": "t.0",
      "tabTitle": "Tab 1",
      "segmentId": null,
      "startIndex": 1525,
      "endIndex": 1551,
      "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT",
      "isListItem": false,
      "listId": null,
      "nestingLevel": null,
      "table": {
        "tableStartIndex": 1508,
        "rowIndex": 0,
        "columnIndex": 0
      },
      "text": "敵の防御力800、術耐性30は、どちらもB+です。",
      "protectedControls": []
    },
    {
      "paragraphId": "P00067",
      "path": "tabs.t.0.body.content[23].table.rows[0].cells[0].content[2]",
      "tabId": "t.0",
      "tabTitle": "Tab 1",
      "segmentId": null,
      "startIndex": 1551,
      "endIndex": 1581,
      "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT",
      "isListItem": false,
      "listId": null,
      "nestingLevel": null,
      "table": {
        "tableStartIndex": 1508,
        "rowIndex": 0,
        "columnIndex": 0
      },
      "text": "物理: max(1000 − 800, 50) = 200",
      "protectedControls": []
    },
    {
      "paragraphId": "P00068",
      "path": "tabs.t.0.body.content[23].table.rows[0].cells[0].content[3]",
      "tabId": "t.0",
      "tabTitle": "Tab 1",
      "segmentId": null,
      "startIndex": 1581,
      "endIndex": 1618,
      "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT",
      "isListItem": false,
      "listId": null,
      "nestingLevel": null,
      "table": {
        "tableStartIndex": 1508,
        "rowIndex": 0,
        "columnIndex": 0
      },
      "text": "術　: max(1000 × (1 − 0.30), 50) = 700",
      "protectedControls": []
    },
    {
      "paragraphId": "P00069",
      "path": "tabs.t.0.body.content[23].table.rows[0].cells[0].content[4]",
      "tabId": "t.0",
      "tabTitle": "Tab 1",
      "segmentId": null,
      "startIndex": 1618,
      "endIndex": 1644,
      "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT",
      "isListItem": false,
      "listId": null,
      "nestingLevel": null,
      "table": {
        "tableStartIndex": 1508,
        "rowIndex": 0,
        "columnIndex": 0
      },
      "text": "結論: 同じランクでも、受けるダメージは一致しない",
      "protectedControls": []
    },
    {
      "paragraphId": "P00070",
      "path": "tabs.t.0.body.content[24]",
      "tabId": "t.0",
      "tabTitle": "Tab 1",
      "segmentId": null,
      "startIndex": 1645,
      "endIndex": 1646,
      "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT",
      "isListItem": false,
      "listId": null,
      "nestingLevel": null,
      "table": null,
      "text": "",
      "protectedControls": []
    },
    {
      "paragraphId": "P00071",
      "path": "tabs.t.0.body.content[25]",
      "tabId": "t.0",
      "tabTitle": "Tab 1",
      "segmentId": null,
      "startIndex": 1646,
      "endIndex": 1700,
      "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT",
      "isListItem": true,
      "listId": "kix.list.10",
      "nestingLevel": null,
      "table": null,
      "text": "物理攻撃は1ヒット攻撃力が低いほど防御力に止められやすく、高いほど防御力を上回った分を通しやすくなります。",
      "protectedControls": []
    },
    {
      "paragraphId": "P00072",
      "path": "tabs.t.0.body.content[26]",
      "tabId": "t.0",
      "tabTitle": "Tab 1",
      "segmentId": null,
      "startIndex": 1700,
      "endIndex": 1740,
      "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT",
      "isListItem": true,
      "listId": "kix.list.10",
      "nestingLevel": null,
      "table": null,
      "text": "術耐性は割合軽減なので、同じRESなら攻撃力が変わっても軽減率は原則同じです。",
      "protectedControls": []
    },
    {
      "paragraphId": "P00073",
      "path": "tabs.t.0.body.content[27]",
      "tabId": "t.0",
      "tabTitle": "Tab 1",
      "segmentId": null,
      "startIndex": 1740,
      "endIndex": 1766,
      "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT",
      "isListItem": true,
      "listId": "kix.list.10",
      "nestingLevel": null,
      "table": null,
      "text": "確定ダメージは、防御力・術耐性の影響を受けません。",
      "protectedControls": []
    },
    {
      "paragraphId": "P00074",
      "path": "tabs.t.0.body.content[28]",
      "tabId": "t.0",
      "tabTitle": "Tab 1",
      "segmentId": null,
      "startIndex": 1766,
      "endIndex": 1791,
      "namedStyleType": "HEADING_1",
      "isListItem": false,
      "listId": null,
      "nestingLevel": null,
      "table": null,
      "text": "4. Enemy Analysis での使い分け",
      "protectedControls": []
    },
    {
      "paragraphId": "P00075",
      "path": "tabs.t.0.body.content[29]",
      "tabId": "t.0",
      "tabTitle": "Tab 1",
      "segmentId": null,
      "startIndex": 1791,
      "endIndex": 1822,
      "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT",
      "isListItem": true,
      "listId": "kix.list.11",
      "nestingLevel": null,
      "table": null,
      "text": "「ゲーム内評価」で、物理と術の通りやすさを大まかに判断する。",
      "protectedControls": []
    },
    {
      "paragraphId": "P00076",
      "path": "tabs.t.0.body.content[30]",
      "tabId": "t.0",
      "tabTitle": "Tab 1",
      "segmentId": null,
      "startIndex": 1822,
      "endIndex": 1852,
      "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT",
      "isListItem": true,
      "listId": "kix.list.11",
      "nestingLevel": null,
      "table": null,
      "text": "「実数値」または敵詳細で、境界内のどこにいるかを確認する。",
      "protectedControls": []
    },
    {
      "paragraphId": "P00077",
      "path": "tabs.t.0.body.content[31]",
      "tabId": "t.0",
      "tabTitle": "Tab 1",
      "segmentId": null,
      "startIndex": 1852,
      "endIndex": 1888,
      "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT",
      "isListItem": true,
      "listId": "kix.list.11",
      "nestingLevel": null,
      "table": null,
      "text": "ダメージ計算機へ実数値を入力し、1ヒット・DPS・総ダメージを比べる。",
      "protectedControls": []
    },
    {
      "paragraphId": "P00078",
      "path": "tabs.t.0.body.content[32]",
      "tabId": "t.0",
      "tabTitle": "Tab 1",
      "segmentId": null,
      "startIndex": 1888,
      "endIndex": 1932,
      "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT",
      "isListItem": true,
      "listId": "kix.list.11",
      "nestingLevel": null,
      "table": null,
      "text": "ステージ補正、形態、自己強化、デバフや無視効果がある場合は基礎値だけで結論を出さない。",
      "protectedControls": []
    },
    {
      "paragraphId": "P00079",
      "path": "tabs.t.0.body.content[33]",
      "tabId": "t.0",
      "tabTitle": "Tab 1",
      "segmentId": null,
      "startIndex": 1932,
      "endIndex": 1934,
      "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT",
      "isListItem": false,
      "listId": null,
      "nestingLevel": null,
      "table": null,
      "text": "",
      "protectedControls": []
    },
    {
      "paragraphId": "P00080",
      "path": "tabs.t.0.body.content[34]",
      "tabId": "t.0",
      "tabTitle": "Tab 1",
      "segmentId": null,
      "startIndex": 1934,
      "endIndex": 1947,
      "namedStyleType": "HEADING_1",
      "isListItem": false,
      "listId": null,
      "nestingLevel": null,
      "table": null,
      "text": "5. 表示値の前提と例外",
      "protectedControls": []
    },
    {
      "paragraphId": "P00081",
      "path": "tabs.t.0.body.content[35]",
      "tabId": "t.0",
      "tabTitle": "Tab 1",
      "segmentId": null,
      "startIndex": 1947,
      "endIndex": 2038,
      "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT",
      "isListItem": false,
      "listId": null,
      "nestingLevel": null,
      "table": null,
      "text": "基礎値: JP版ゲームデータの敵図鑑と戦闘データを敵IDで結合し、防御力 def と術耐性 magicResistance を読み取ります。複数レベルでは原則レベル0を採用します。",
      "protectedControls": []
    },
    {
      "paragraphId": "P00082",
      "path": "tabs.t.0.body.content[36]",
      "tabId": "t.0",
      "tabTitle": "Tab 1",
      "segmentId": null,
      "startIndex": 2038,
      "endIndex": 2112,
      "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT",
      "isListItem": false,
      "listId": null,
      "nestingLevel": null,
      "table": null,
      "text": "ステージ差: ゲーム内のSp.は、そのステージの敵が図鑑の標準情報と異なることを示します。本アプリはステージ固有条件やイベント補正を反映しません。",
      "protectedControls": []
    },
    {
      "paragraphId": "P00083",
      "path": "tabs.t.0.body.content[37]",
      "tabId": "t.0",
      "tabTitle": "Tab 1",
      "segmentId": null,
      "startIndex": 2112,
      "endIndex": 2168,
      "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT",
      "isListItem": false,
      "listId": null,
      "nestingLevel": null,
      "table": null,
      "text": "形態・能力: 形態変化、自己強化、強襲条件、契約、デバフや防御・術耐性無視により、戦闘中の実効値は変わります。",
      "protectedControls": []
    },
    {
      "paragraphId": "P00084",
      "path": "tabs.t.0.body.content[38]",
      "tabId": "t.0",
      "tabTitle": "Tab 1",
      "segmentId": null,
      "startIndex": 2168,
      "endIndex": 2229,
      "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT",
      "isListItem": false,
      "listId": null,
      "nestingLevel": null,
      "table": null,
      "text": "境界と丸め: 評価は丸め前の値で判定します。境界付近に小数値があると、整数表示との見た目が直感に合わない場合があります。",
      "protectedControls": []
    },
    {
      "paragraphId": "P00085",
      "path": "tabs.t.0.body.content[39].table.rows[0].cells[0].content[0]",
      "tabId": "t.0",
      "tabTitle": "Tab 1",
      "segmentId": null,
      "startIndex": 2232,
      "endIndex": 2241,
      "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT",
      "isListItem": false,
      "listId": null,
      "nestingLevel": null,
      "table": {
        "tableStartIndex": 2229,
        "rowIndex": 0,
        "columnIndex": 0
      },
      "text": "用語の混同に注意",
      "protectedControls": []
    },
    {
      "paragraphId": "P00086",
      "path": "tabs.t.0.body.content[39].table.rows[0].cells[0].content[1]",
      "tabId": "t.0",
      "tabTitle": "Tab 1",
      "segmentId": null,
      "startIndex": 2241,
      "endIndex": 2300,
      "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT",
      "isListItem": false,
      "listId": null,
      "nestingLevel": null,
      "table": {
        "tableStartIndex": 2229,
        "rowIndex": 0,
        "columnIndex": 0
      },
      "text": "術耐性（RES）は術ダメージを軽減する値です。スタン・睡眠などへの状態異常耐性、元素耐性、損傷耐性とは別の項目です。",
      "protectedControls": []
    },
    {
      "paragraphId": "P00087",
      "path": "tabs.t.0.body.content[40]",
      "tabId": "t.0",
      "tabTitle": "Tab 1",
      "segmentId": null,
      "startIndex": 2301,
      "endIndex": 2302,
      "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT",
      "isListItem": false,
      "listId": null,
      "nestingLevel": null,
      "table": null,
      "text": "",
      "protectedControls": []
    },
    {
      "paragraphId": "P00088",
      "path": "tabs.t.0.body.content[41]",
      "tabId": "t.0",
      "tabTitle": "Tab 1",
      "segmentId": null,
      "startIndex": 2302,
      "endIndex": 2317,
      "namedStyleType": "HEADING_1",
      "isListItem": false,
      "listId": null,
      "nestingLevel": null,
      "table": null,
      "text": "6. 読み取りチェックリスト",
      "protectedControls": []
    },
    {
      "paragraphId": "P00089",
      "path": "tabs.t.0.body.content[42]",
      "tabId": "t.0",
      "tabTitle": "Tab 1",
      "segmentId": null,
      "startIndex": 2317,
      "endIndex": 2345,
      "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT",
      "isListItem": true,
      "listId": "kix.list.10",
      "nestingLevel": null,
      "table": null,
      "text": "文字ランクは正確な数値ではなく、範囲だと理解している。",
      "protectedControls": []
    },
    {
      "paragraphId": "P00090",
      "path": "tabs.t.0.body.content[43]",
      "tabId": "t.0",
      "tabTitle": "Tab 1",
      "segmentId": null,
      "startIndex": 2345,
      "endIndex": 2376,
      "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT",
      "isListItem": true,
      "listId": "kix.list.10",
      "nestingLevel": null,
      "table": null,
      "text": "防御力は固定値減算、術耐性は割合軽減として別々に読んでいる。",
      "protectedControls": []
    },
    {
      "paragraphId": "P00091",
      "path": "tabs.t.0.body.content[44]",
      "tabId": "t.0",
      "tabTitle": "Tab 1",
      "segmentId": null,
      "startIndex": 2376,
      "endIndex": 2409,
      "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT",
      "isListItem": true,
      "listId": "kix.list.10",
      "nestingLevel": null,
      "table": null,
      "text": "実数値、Sp.、形態・能力説明、ステージ固有補正を確認している。",
      "protectedControls": []
    },
    {
      "paragraphId": "P00092",
      "path": "tabs.t.0.body.content[45]",
      "tabId": "t.0",
      "tabTitle": "Tab 1",
      "segmentId": null,
      "startIndex": 2409,
      "endIndex": 2433,
      "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT",
      "isListItem": true,
      "listId": "kix.list.10",
      "nestingLevel": null,
      "table": null,
      "text": "最終判断はダメージ計算機で実数値を使っている。",
      "protectedControls": []
    },
    {
      "paragraphId": "P00093",
      "path": "tabs.t.0.body.content[46]",
      "tabId": "t.0",
      "tabTitle": "Tab 1",
      "segmentId": null,
      "startIndex": 2433,
      "endIndex": 2441,
      "namedStyleType": "HEADING_1",
      "isListItem": false,
      "listId": null,
      "nestingLevel": null,
      "table": null,
      "text": "7. 参照情報",
      "protectedControls": []
    },
    {
      "paragraphId": "P00094",
      "path": "tabs.t.0.body.content[47]",
      "tabId": "t.0",
      "tabTitle": "Tab 1",
      "segmentId": null,
      "startIndex": 2441,
      "endIndex": 2557,
      "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT",
      "isListItem": false,
      "listId": null,
      "nestingLevel": null,
      "table": null,
      "text": "実装根拠: src/lib/enemyData.ts（換算・データ取得）、src/lib/damageCalculator.ts（基本式）、src/components/EnemyAnalysis.tsx（表示切替・基礎値注記）。",
      "protectedControls": []
    },
    {
      "paragraphId": "P00095",
      "path": "tabs.t.0.body.content[48]",
      "tabId": "t.0",
      "tabTitle": "Tab 1",
      "segmentId": null,
      "startIndex": 2557,
      "endIndex": 2592,
      "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT",
      "isListItem": true,
      "listId": "kix.list.10",
      "nestingLevel": null,
      "table": null,
      "text": "公式: [アークナイツ公式 アプリ更新のお知らせ](https://www.arknights.jp/news/377)（2023-12-21の敵図鑑仕様変更）",
      "protectedControls": []
    },
    {
      "paragraphId": "P00096",
      "path": "tabs.t.0.body.content[49]",
      "tabId": "t.0",
      "tabTitle": "Tab 1",
      "segmentId": null,
      "startIndex": 2592,
      "endIndex": 2629,
      "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT",
      "isListItem": true,
      "listId": "kix.list.10",
      "nestingLevel": null,
      "table": null,
      "text": "開発側告知: [敵方档案库优化内容前瞻](https://www.taptap.cn/moment/415548477913697519)（表示項目、Sp.、形態・耐性説明）",
      "protectedControls": []
    },
    {
      "paragraphId": "P00097",
      "path": "tabs.t.0.body.content[50]",
      "tabId": "t.0",
      "tabTitle": "Tab 1",
      "segmentId": null,
      "startIndex": 2629,
      "endIndex": 2700,
      "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT",
      "isListItem": true,
      "listId": "kix.list.10",
      "nestingLevel": null,
      "table": null,
      "text": "補助資料: [Arknights Terra Wiki - DEF / RES / UI UX Changes](https://arknights.wiki.gg/wiki/UI_UX_Changes)（10段階表示と改修内容の整理）",
      "protectedControls": []
    },
    {
      "paragraphId": "P00098",
      "path": "tabs.t.0.body.content[51]",
